  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Badeland.Runtime::Badeland.World.ReadableNote
  title: A wet scrap of paper
  text: 'You''re awake. Good.


    You were swallowed. Whatever it was, it was bigger than the whole waterpark, and now you are inside it. The ground is warm. The walls breathe.


    Stay together. Look for a way on.'
  radius: 3
